&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/wiki/Issue-Guidelines&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
